# UI conventions

- Use shadcn/ui components from `@/components/ui/*`. Add new ones with `npx shadcn@latest add <name>`. Don't hand-edit generated UI files unless fixing a bug.
- Tailwind v4 with theme tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border`, ...). Don't hardcode colors except in email templates. The brand blue is `--primary` in `globals.css`.
- Fonts: Geist variables are set on `<html>` in `src/app/layout.tsx`. Don't move them to `<body>`.
- Native `<select>` is used in forms (simple and works with FormData). Keep the shared `selectClass` styling.
- Inputs: `className="h-10"` and `aria-invalid` for error states. Show errors below fields via `FormField`.
- Use icons from `lucide-react`. Layouts are mobile-first (`sm:`/`md:`/`lg:` breakpoints) with a `max-w-6xl` container on marketing pages.
- Every page must stay usable on a 375px-wide screen.
